# Build context for apps/*/Dockerfile (the repository root). Keep it to what
# `pnpm install` and `pnpm build` need, so unrelated changes do not bust the
# layer cache and nothing local or secret is sent to the builder.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.turbo/
**/.cache/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

.git/
.github/
docs/
infra/
*.md
**/Dockerfile
**/*.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
compose*.yml

.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
